==Description==
The '''Hexscaped Nametag''' was obtained from the badge Triumpher of All Nights badge, which was gotten by triumphing all [[Hexscape Event]] nights on the Hard difficulty in a row, without losing or restarting. The continue button had to be used to play the next night.

The '''Hexscaped Nametag''' has a blue, purple and blue gradient text with a translucent black outline. A purple mist and a blue flare can be seen behind the nametag. The entire nametag is inside a purple frame, which has a pumpkin at the top and a crystal at the bottom. The frame will stretch in/out to cover the player's entire display name.


